Never mind. I got it working. I had to include a PHP file that was saved in 
unicode in order for it to display unicode characters on the page. So it 
was a PHP issue and not a MySQL issue after all.

I don't have an opinion about whether or not non-standard Lojban should be 
allowed on jboselkei. I think we should probably put it to a vote. Whatever 
people here decide on, I'll put a notice on the website.


